&#x1F355;&#x2764;&#xFE0F; The best part of any season? Sharing it together. &#x1F355;&#x2764;&#xFE0F;

From our NFL Season Kickoff Party featuring food, giveaways, raffles, and fun to a special Meet &amp; Greet with Detroit Tigers catcher Dillon Dingler over lunch, colleagues at the Global Resource Center recently had the opportunity to enjoy some unforgettable experiences together.

Moments like these create opportunities to connect, celebrate, and strengthen the culture that makes Little Caesars a great place to work.

Family. Fun. Pizza. And a little Detroit sports pride. &#x1F3C8;&#x26BE;&#x1F355;

&#x1F342; Fall has officially arrived! &#x1F342;
&#xA0;
Sweater weather, changing leaves, football weekends, and pizza nights... what&apos;s not to love? &#x1F355;&#x1F9E1;

Here&apos;s to cooler temperatures, cozy moments, and sharing a few slices with friends and family!

Happy First Day of Fall from Little Caesars! &#x1F341;&#x1F342;

It&#x2019;s National Pepperoni Pizza Day! &#x1F355;&#x1F389;

And honestly, is there a better way to celebrate than with a HOT-N-READY&#xAE; Pepperoni pizza from Little Caesars?

Whether you&apos;re grabbing one for game day, dinner or just because, today is the perfect excuse to enjoy one of pizza&#x2019;s most iconic toppings.

Happy National Pepperoni Pizza Day! &#x1F9E1;&#x1F355;

Football season is back! &#x1F3C8;&#x1F355;
&#xA0;
We&#x2019;re excited to kick off our fifth season as the Official Pizza Partner of the NFL with an even bigger season ahead.
&#xA0;
This year, we&#x2019;re bringing the Pizza! Pizza! spirit to gameday with an incredible lineup of NFL talent, including Justin Jefferson, Jared Goff and George Kittle, along with our biggest local team presence yet.
&#xA0;
From the first kickoff to the final whistle, we&#x2019;re giving football fans even more reasons to make Little Caesars their gameday go-to. &#x1F355;&#x1F3C8;
&#xA0;
Let&#x2019;s make this season a great one!

Dairy Month is about more than just the products we produce - it is about the people leading the way behind the scenes. Behind every package of cheese, every challenge, and every win, are the Plant Managers who keep our sites moving forward each day. This month, we are shining a spotlight on these leaders who make it happen with the many dedicated employee-owners at their sites.&#xA0;
&#xA0;
Please join us in recognizing our first three&#xA0;featured&#xA0;Plant Managers for their exceptional leadership and commitment to providing our customers nationwide with safe, quality product each and every day.&#xA0;
&#x1F4CD; Brady Bornhauser &#x2013; La Crosse, WI
&#x1F4CD; James Montgomery &#x2013; Abilene, TX
&#x1F4CD; David Bohman &#x2013; Hiram, OH
&#xA0;
Let us know where you&apos;re supporting us from by leaving a &#x1F9C0; for Wisconsin, &#x1F920; for Texas, or &#x1F330; for Ohio in the comments below! &#x1F447;

&#x1F3C8; Friday night lights are back, and we&apos;re proud to kick off a new partnership with Dave Campbell&apos;s Texas Football.
&#xA0;
Community has always been at the heart of everything we do. Supporting local schools and organizations is about showing up, celebrating local traditions, and backing the people and places that bring communities together. That&apos;s why we&apos;re excited to partner with an organization that has been telling the stories of Texas football for generations.
&#xA0;
This season, you&apos;ll see Casey&apos;s and <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/dave-campbell&apos;s-texas-football?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Dave Campbell&apos;s Texas Football</a> hitting the road to highlight outstanding communities across the state and recognize the people who make Texas football special. Keep an eye out for our Team of the Week, Scholar-Athlete of the Week, and special stops at select football games throughout the season.
&#xA0;
We&apos;re just getting started, and we can&apos;t wait to be part of the traditions, pride, and passion that make Texas football unlike anything else.
&#xA0;
See you under the lights.

Fire Prevention Month is here, and some Domino&#x2019;s customers may get more than pizza at their door. &#x1F692;&#x1F440;

Throughout this month, participating franchise-owned stores across the U.S. are teaming up with local fire departments for surprise pizza deliveries via fire engine and free smoke alarm checks. If the customer&#x2019;s smoke alarms work, the order is free. If not, firefighters will replace the batteries or install working alarms at no cost. Either way, it&#x2019;s a win!

For 19 years, we&#x2019;ve proudly partnered with the National Fire Protection Association (<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/nfpa?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>NFPA</a>) and local fire departments to promote fire safety. Thank you to the NFPA and firefighters nationwide for helping keep our customers and communities safe.

Bryce Clark, Central Region General Manager of the Year, got his start at his local Domino&apos;s after a friend recommended the job and he&apos;s never looked back. &#x1F64C;

Over the past eight years with franchise A&amp;M Pizza, Bryce has continued to grow his skills and develop as a leader, ultimately becoming a general manager.

He leads his team with a focus on accountability, resilience and building strong relationships, helping create an environment where both people and the business can thrive.

