Before launching nationwide this week, the Domino made a few stops on campus. We visited select universities during back-to-college festivities to give students an exclusive first taste of our newest menu item.&#xA0;&#x1F440; 
&#xA0;
With packed schedules and the never-ending meal debate, we wanted to introduce a new option for students to grab on-the-go. Shoutout to everyone who joined in on the fun!

