We recently hosted team members from across Domino&apos;s to share stories about projects, challenges and key initiatives that have had a meaningful impact on their careers and our business. &#x1F3A4; 

Through those experiences, we reflected on the mindsets and actions that helped their teams drive meaningful results. Those stories served as the foundation for introducing our new Ways of Working (WoW!), a framework designed to reinforce the behaviors that help us continue striving for excellence.

Through this event, we had the opportunity to connect around a shared vision for the future and reflect on the ways we&apos;re made better, together.&#xA0;&#x1F4A1; 

