Securing Uber reaches far beyond the app on your phone.

3 months into the role, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/philipmmartin?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Philip Martin</a>, our Chief Information Security Officer, shares 3 things that have stood out &#x1F447;

&#x1F310; The range of problems to solve
&quot;Most people know Uber through rides or delivery. Since joining, I&#x2019;ve gotten a much deeper appreciation for the range of problems behind that experience: identity, payments, infrastructure, AI, and an increasingly connected physical world. If you like working across disciplines, there&#x2019;s an extraordinary amount to dig into here.&quot;

&#x1F916; The chance to rethink security with AI
&quot;What&#x2019;s exciting here is that we get to work on both sides of AI: helping Uber use it responsibly, and using it to make security itself better. That creates an opportunity to rethink how we identify risk, investigate threats, and respond, not just make the same processes a little faster.&quot;

&#x1F49A; The impact of security here is unusually tangible
&quot;Our work connects directly to people&#x2019;s everyday lives. Protecting this platform means protecting the trust of someone getting home, a courier making a delivery, or a driver earning a living. The scale is impressive; the human connection is what makes it meaningful.&quot;

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fwhatmovesus&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#WhatMovesUs</a>

Helping more people access care, one ride at a time &#x1F5A4;

For <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jenvaras?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Jen Shepherd</a>, Global Head of <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/uber-health/?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Uber Health</a>, that&#x2019;s what makes the work personal: &#x201C;Something as simple as a ride can be life-changing, and I&apos;m incredibly proud that we&apos;re using Uber&apos;s technology and scale to help more people get the care they need.&#x201D;

Today, more than 5,000 health and social care organizations use Uber Health each month. The impact? Fewer missed appointments. Lower transportation costs. More people getting to the care they need.

Learn what this means for health benefits heading into open enrollment in <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/forbes-magazine?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Forbes</a> &#x2192; <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/eDQwSZxS?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/eDQwSZxS</a>

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fwhatmovesus&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#WhatMovesUs</a>

New customers? Coming right up. &#x1F6CE;&#xFE0F;

Dimitris Tselepatiotis, owner of Jimmy&#x2019;s Gyros, wanted to bring his Greek-American family background to Chicago. With Uber Eats fueling growth, Jimmy&#x2019;s has been able to reach new customers that wouldn&#x2019;t have been otherwise possible, and run promotions to help get business booming.

Explore what Uber Eats can do for your restaurant: <a class="link" href="https://bit.ly/4dEpsH7?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://bit.ly/4dEpsH7</a>

Bring your family to work day, the Uber way &#x2728;

We opened the doors to our Hyderabad and Bangalore tech offices for Uber FamJam, giving our families a chance to see where we work, meet the people behind the tech, and experience a little of what makes Uber, Uber. 

Take a look at the highlights &#x1F3A5;&#x1F447;

