&#x1F310; The range of problems to solve
&quot;Most people know Uber through rides or delivery. Since joining, I&#x2019;ve gotten a much deeper appreciation for the range of problems behind that experience: identity, payments, infrastructure, AI, and an increasingly connected physical world. If you like working across disciplines, there&#x2019;s an extraordinary amount to dig into here.&quot;

