&quot;What&#x2019;s exciting here is that we get to work on both sides of AI: helping Uber use it responsibly, and using it to make security itself better. That creates an opportunity to rethink how we identify risk, investigate threats, and respond, not just make the same processes a little faster.&quot;

&#x1F49A; The impact of security here is unusually tangible
&quot;Our work connects directly to people&#x2019;s everyday lives. Protecting this platform means protecting the trust of someone getting home, a courier making a delivery, or a driver earning a living. The scale is impressive; the human connection is what makes it meaningful.&quot;

