Today we announce our acquisition of <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/la-terra-fina?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>La Terra Fina</a>, maker of premium dairy-based dips, spreads and quiches.&#xA0;The acquisition&#xA0;expands our portfolio into grocery and club deli departments, and creates a&#xA0;Deli Business Unit alongside Consumer Products and Food Service &amp; Ingredients. We are honored to also welcome approximately 250 new employees in Union City, CA to the Sargento Family.
&#xA0;
&#x201C;For three generations, Sargento has&#xA0;built our success through industry-leading innovation and a real commitment to our stakeholders,&#x201D; said <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/louie-gentine-645a955?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Louie Gentine</a>, our 3rd generation Chairman and CEO.&#xA0;&#x201C;Entering the Deli&#xA0;is an exciting opportunity for the Sargento Family, that expands our capabilities, builds on the&#xA0;strength of the La Terra Fina&#xAE; brand and&#xA0;brings&#xA0;new consumers to Sargento.&#x201D;
&#xA0;
The closing of the sale has sparked promotions and new leadership roles across our three business units: Consumer Products, Food Service &amp; Ingredients and today, Deli.
&#xA0;
&#x201C;The acquisition of La Terra Fina represents an important milestone and growth engine for Sargento. It will strengthen our ability to deliver value for our employees, customers, suppliers and shareholders,&#x201D; said COO <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/michael-pellegrino-9531837?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Michael Pellegrino</a>. &#x201C;I want to congratulate Erin, Jeremy and Joy on their new roles as we align our leadership structure to support this exciting venture. Their leadership and expertise will help us welcome La Terra Fina to the Sargento Family, serve our stakeholders and continue positioning our company for long-term growth.&#x201D;

